  dialogues:
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c8fcfa5882242b84b8bf1fb55659059e, type: 2}
    emotion: 2
    text: The client is unhappy to hear your team has allowed the screed to be installed
      incorrectly and the screeder has been paid despite the poor work. The insultation
      fix is complete but the screeder points out that the contract says they should
      be offered the opportunity to make good and they weren't. As they weren't offered
      this oppotunity, the screeder doesn't have to pay the contra-charge and it
      comes out of your profit.
